% [Assumption].\n- Beta: 1.46 [Actual - vendor, window unknown].\n- Cost of equity: 4.70% + 1.46 \u00d7 5.0% = 12.0% [Arithmetic/Assumption].\n- Pre-tax cost of debt: 5.5% [Assumption].\n- Debt weight: $1.99B / ($1.99B + $33.1B) \u2248 5.7% [Arithmetic].\n- WACC = 0.943 \u00d7 12.0% + 0.057 \u00d7 5.5% \u00d7 0.82 = 11.3% \u2192 use 11.25% [Arithmetic/Assumption].\nTerminal growth: 3.0% [Assumption - long-run nominal GDP].\n\nForecast table (Base case) \u2014 [$B]:\n\n| Year | Revenue | Op Margin | OI* | D&A | Capex | \u0394WC | FCFF |\n|------|---------|-----------|-----|------|-------|-----|------|\n| 2026 | 4.62 | 20.5% | 0.947 | 0.29 | 0.17 | 0.07 | 0.827 |\n| 2027 | 4.96 | 21.5% | 1.066 | 0.31 | 0.18 | 0.07 | 0.934 |\n| 2028 | 5.31 | 22.5% | 1.195 | 0.34 | 0.19 | 0.08 | 1.050 |\n| 2029 | 5.65 | 23.5% | 1.328 | 0.36 | 0.20 | 0.08 | 1.170 |\n| 2030 | 5.98 | 24.5% | 1.465 | 0.38 | 0.21 | 0.09 | 1.280 |\n| 2031 | 6.28 | 25.0% | 1.570 | 0.40 | 0.22 | 0.09 | 1.377 |\n| 2032 | 6.56 | 25.0% | 1.640 | 0.42 | 0.23 | 0.10 | 1.435 |\n| 2033 | 6.82 | 25.0% | 1.705 | 0.43 | 0.24 | 0.10 | 1.488 |\n| 2034 | 7.02 | 25.0% | 1.755 | 0.45 | 0.25 | 0.10 | 1.539 |\n| 2035 | 7.20 | 25.0% | 1.800 | 0.46 | 0.25 | 0.10 | 1.586 |\n\nFCFF = OI \u00d7 (1\u22120.18 tax [Assumption]) + D&A \u2212 capex \u2212 \u0394WC [Arithmetic/Assumption].\nRevenue path: FY26 $4.62B midpoint guide [Actual - company guidance]; FY27 +7.3% [Assumption, consistent with sell-side EPS growth 13.6% [Estimate - Zacks]]; 2028\u201330 decay 7%\u21926% [Assumption]; 2031\u201335 decay 5%\u21922.5% [Assumption]. Beyond FY26 guidance, the path is NOT established by management; sensitivity below covers the range.\nCapex/D&A/\u0394WC as % of revenue sourced from FY25 actuals [Actual] and held roughly constant [Assumption].\n\nBase-case valuation:\nSum PV explicit FCFF (WACC 11.25%) \u2248 $6.95B [Arithmetic].\nTerminal value at end-2035 = 1.586\u00d71.03/(0.1125\u22120.03) = $19.81B [Arithmetic/Assumption].\nPV terminal